msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Show Documentation for %1"
msgstr "Mostrar a documentación sobre %1"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:174
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'helper' object"
msgid "The <emphasis>helper</emphasis> object contains some useful functions."
msgstr "O obxecto <emphasis>helper</emphasis> contén algunhas funcións útiles."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:179
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'network' object"
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>network</emphasis> object is used request documents from the "
"internet.<nl/>"
msgstr ""
"O obxecto <emphasis>network</emphasis> úsase para solicitar documentos de "
"internet.<nl/>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:184
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'storage' object"
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>storage</emphasis> object can be used to store some script "
"specific values in memory or on disk.<nl/>"
msgstr ""
"O obxecto <emphasis>storage</emphasis> úsase para almacenar valores "
"específicos dun script, ben en memoria ben en disco.<nl/>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:189
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'result' object"
msgid ""
"The result object is used to store all parsed departure/arrival/journey "
"items. Call <emphasis>result.addData({Target: 'Sample', DepartureDateTime: "
"new Date()})</emphasis> to add new data."
msgstr ""
"O obxecto <emphasis>result</emphasis> úsase para almacenar todos os "
"elementos analizados de saídas, chegadas e rutas de viaxe. Execute "
"<emphasis>result.addData({Target: 'Exemplo', DepartureDateTime: new Date()})"
"</emphasis> para engadir datos novos."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:251
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'features' function"
msgid ""
"Should be implemented to tell which features the script supports.<nl/>This "
"function is called by the data engine."
msgstr ""
"Debería definirse para informar de que funcionalidades fornece o script.<nl/"
"> O motor de datos encárgase de chamar a esta función."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:269
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'getTimetable' function"
msgid ""
"Requests and parses departure/arrival documents. The argument has the "
"following properties: stop, dateTime (Date object), count, dataType "
"('departures' or 'arrivals'), city.<nl/>This function is called by the data "
"engine. Found departures/arrivals can be handed over to the data engine like "
"this:<nl/><icode>  // Add timetable data to the result set</icode><nl/"
"><icode>  result.addData( {TransportLine: '603',</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   TypeOfVehicle: 'bus',</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   Target: 'Samplestreet',</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   DepartureDateTime: new Date(),</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   Delay: 4} );</icode><nl/><nl/><note>You "
"<emphasis>can</emphasis> return a string array with keywords that affect all "
"departures/arrivals. Currently only one such keyword is supported: "
"<emphasis>'no delays'</emphasis>, used to indicate that there is no delay "
"information for the given stop. The data engine can then use a higher "
"timeout for the next data update. When delay information is available "
"updates are done more often, because delays may change.</note>"
msgstr ""
"Solicita e analiza documentos de saídas e chegadas. O argumento conta coas "
"seguintes propiedades: stop («parada»), dateTime («data e hora», obxecto de "
"tipo Date), count («número»), dataType («tipo de datos», pode ser "
"'departures' para saídas ou 'arrivals' para chegadas) e city («cidade»).<nl/"
"> O motor de datos executa a función. O seguinte exemplo demostra como "
"facilitarlle ao motor de datos as saídas e chegadas que se atopen:<nl/> "
"<icode>  // Engádense os datos da táboa de horarios ao grupo de resultados.</"
"icode><nl/> <icode>  result.addData( {TransportLine: '603',</icode><nl/> "
"<icode>                   TypeOfVehicle: 'bus',</icode><nl/> "
"<icode>                   Target: 'Rúa de exemplo',</icode><nl/> "
"<icode>                   DepartureDateTime: new Date(),</icode><nl/> "
"<icode>                   Delay: 4} );</icode><nl/> <nl/> "
"<note><emphasis>Pode</emphasis> devolver unha lista de datos con palabras "
"clave que afecten a todas as saídas e chegadas. Actualmente só se pode usar "
"unha palabra clave, <emphasis>'no delays'</emphasis>, coa que pode indicar "
"que a parada indicada non fornece información sobre os atrasos. O motor de "
"datos pode entón usar un límite de tempo maior para a seguinte actualización "
"de datos. Cando si que hai dispoñíbel información sobre os atrasos, as "
"actualizacións prodúcense con maior frecuencia, dado que os atrasos poden "
"cambiar.</note>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:321
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'getJourneys' function"
msgid ""
"Requests and parses journey documents. The argument has the following "
"properties: originStop, targetStop, dateTime (Date object), count, dataType, "
"city.<nl/>This function is called by the data engine. Found journeys can be "
"handed over to the data engine like this:<nl/><icode>  // Add timetable data "
"to the result set</icode><nl/><icode>  result.addData( {StartStopName: 'A',</"
"icode><nl/><icode>                   TargetStopName: 'B',</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   Target: 'Samplestreet',</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   DepartureDateTime: new Date(),</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   ArrivalDateTime: new Date(),</icode><nl/"
"><icode>                   Changes: 3,</icode><nl/><icode>                   "
"Pricing: '2,30 €'} );</icode><nl/><nl/>"
msgstr ""
"Solicita e analiza documentos de rutas de viaxe. O argumento conta coas "
"seguintes propiedades: originStop («parada de orixe»), targetStop («parada "
"de destino»), dateTime («data e hora», obxecto de tipo Date), count "
"(«número»), dataType («tipo de datos») e city («cidade»).<nl/> O motor de "
"datos executa a función. O seguinte exemplo demostra como facilitarlle ao "
"motor de datos as rutas de viaxe que se atopen:<nl/> <icode>  // Engádense "
"os datos da táboa de horarios ao grupo de resultados.</icode><nl/> <icode>  "
"result.addData( {StartStopName: 'A',</icode><nl/> <icode>                   "
"TargetStopName: 'B',</icode><nl/> <icode>                   Target: 'Rúa de "
"exemplo',</icode><nl/> <icode>                   DepartureDateTime: new Date"
"(),</icode><nl/> <icode>                   ArrivalDateTime: new Date(),</"
"icode><nl/> <icode>                   Changes: 3,</icode><nl/> "
"<icode>                   Pricing: '2,30 €'} );</icode><nl/> <nl/>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:346
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'getStopSuggestions' function"
msgid ""
"Requests and parses stop suggestion documents. The argument has the "
"following properties: stop, count, city.<nl/>This function is called by the "
"data engine. The parameter contains the contents of the document body. Found "
"stop data can be handed over to the data engine like this:<nl/><icode>  // "
"Add timetable data to the result set</icode><nl/><icode>  result.addData"
"( {StopName: 'TestName', StopID: 100} );</icode>"
msgstr ""
"Solicita e analiza documentos de suxestións de paradas. O argumento conta "
"coas seguintes propiedades: stop («parada»), count («número») e city "
"(«cidade»).<nl/> O motor de datos executa a función. O parámetro inclúe o "
"contido do corpo do documento. O seguinte exemplo demostra como facilitarlle "
"ao motor de datos os datos da parada:<nl/> <icode>  // Engádense os datos da "
"táboa de horarios ao grupo de resultados.</icode><nl/> <icode>  result."
"addData( {StopName: 'Nome de proba', StopID: 100} );</icode>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:365
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'DepartureDateTime' info"
msgid ""
"The date and time of the departure. Can be a ECMAScript Date object. Use "
"this information instead of DepartureDate and DepartureTime if possible."
msgstr ""
"A data e hora de saída. Pode ser un obxecto ECMAScript de tipo Date. Use "
"esta información en vez de «DepartureDate» e «DepartureTime» cando sexa "
"posíbel."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:368
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Needed for Departures/Journeys"
msgstr "Precísase para saídas/rutas de viaxe"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:371
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'DepartureDate' info"
msgid "The date of the departure."
msgstr "A data da saída."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:375
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'DepartureTime' info"
msgid "The time of the departure."
msgstr "A hora da saída."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:378
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'TypeOfVehicle' info"
msgid "The type of vehicle."
msgstr "O tipo de vehículo."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:381
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'TransportLine' info"
msgid ""
"The name of the public transport line, e.g. '4', '6S', 'S 5', 'RB 24122.'"
msgstr ""
"O nome da liña de transporte público, p.ex. «4», «6S», «S 5», «RB 24122»."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:384 javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:393
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Needed for Departures"
msgstr "Precísase para as saídas"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:387
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'FlightNumber' info"
msgid "Same as TransportLine, used for flights."
msgstr "O mesmo que «TransportLine», para voos."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:391
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Target' info"
msgid "The target of a journey / of a public transport line."
msgstr "O destino dunha ruta de viaxe/dunha liña de transporte público."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:396
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Platform' info"
msgid "The platform at which the vehicle departs/arrives."
msgstr "A plataforma na que o o vehículo sae ou chega."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:400
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Delay' info"
msgid "The delay of a departure/arrival in minutes."
msgstr "O atraso na saída ou chegada en minutos."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:404
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'DelayReason' info"
msgid "The reason of a delay."
msgstr "A razón do atraso."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:408
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'JourneyNews' info"
msgid "Can contain delay / delay reason / other news."
msgstr "Pode conter atrasos / motivos de atrasos / outras novas."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:412
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'JourneyNewsOther' info"
msgid "Other news (not delay / delay reason)."
msgstr "Outras novas (non atrasos / motivo do atraso)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:416
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'JourneyNewsLink' info"
msgid ""
"A link to an html page with journey news.<nl/><note>The url of the service "
"provider is prepended, if a relative path has been matched (starting with "
"'/').</note>"
msgstr ""
"Unha ligazón a unha páxina HTML con información actual sobre as rutas de "
"viaxe.<nl/> <note>Se a ligazón comeza por «/» entenderase que é relativa ao "
"enderezo URL do fornecedor de servizos.</note>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:422
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Operator' info"
msgid "The company that is responsible for the journey."
msgstr "A compañía que é responsábel da ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:425
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Status' info"
msgid ""
"The current status of the departure / arrival. Currently only used for "
"planes."
msgstr ""
"O estado actual da saída ou chegada. Neste momento só se pode empregar en "
"voos."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:429
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'IsNightLine' info"
msgid "A boolean indicating if the transport line is a nightline or not."
msgstr ""
"O booleano indicando se a liña de transporte é unha liña ruta nocturna ou "
"non."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:434
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteStops' info"
msgid ""
"A list of stops of the departure/arrival to it's destination stop or a list "
"of stops of the journey from it's start to it's destination stop.<nl/>If "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis> are both "
"set, they should contain the same number of elements. And elements with "
"equal indices should be associated (the times at which the vehicle is at the "
"stops).<nl/><note>For journeys <emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis> should be used instead of "
"<emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis>.</note>"
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de paradas da saídas ou a chegada ao lugar de destino, ou unha "
"lista de paradas al longo dunha ruta de viaxe.<nl/> Se tanto "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como <emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis> están "
"definidos, deberían conter o mesmo número de elementos. Os elementos que "
"teñan o mesmo índice deberían estar asociados (as horas á que o vehículo "
"pasa polas paradas).<nl/> <note>Para rutas de viaxe debería usar "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis> e <emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</"
"emphasis> en vez de <emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis>.</note>"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:446
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTimes' info"
msgid ""
"A list of times of the departure/arrival to it's destination stop.<nl/>If "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis> are both "
"set, they should contain the same number of elements. And elements with "
"equal indices should be associated (the times at which the vehicle is at the "
"stops)."
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de horas da saídas ou a chegada ao lugar de destino.<nl/> Se "
"tanto <emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como <emphasis>RouteTimes</emphasis> "
"están definidos, deberían conter o mesmo número de elementos. Os elementos "
"que teñan o mesmo índice deberían estar asociados (as horas á que o vehículo "
"pasa polas paradas)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:457
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTimesDeparture' info"
msgid ""
"A list of departure times of the journey.<nl/>If <emphasis>RouteStops</"
"emphasis> and <emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis> are both set, the "
"latter should contain one element less (because the last stop has no "
"departure, only an arrival time). Elements with equal indices should be "
"associated (the times at which the vehicle departs from the stops)."
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de horas de saída da ruta de viaxe.<nl/> Se tanto "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como <emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</"
"emphasis> están definidos, o segundo debería conter un elemento menos, dado "
"que non hai data de saída para a última parada, só de chegada. Os elementos "
"que teñan o mesmo índice deberían estar asociados (as horas á que o vehículo "
"sae das paradas)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:466
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTimesArrival' info"
msgid ""
"A list of arrival times of the journey.<nl/>If <emphasis>RouteStops</"
"emphasis> and <emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis> are both set, the "
"latter should contain one element less (because the first stop has no "
"arrival, only a departure time). Elements with equal indices should be "
"associated (the times at which the vehicle arrives at the stops)."
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de horas de chegada da ruta de viaxe.<nl/> Se tanto "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como <emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis> "
"están definidos, o segundo debería conter un elemento menos, dado que non "
"hai data de chegada para a primeira parada, só de saída. Os elementos que "
"teñan o mesmo índice deberían estar asociados (as horas á que o vehículo "
"chega ás paradas)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:474
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteExactStops' info"
msgid ""
"The number of exact route stops.<nl/>The route stop list in "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> is not complete from the last exact route "
"stop."
msgstr ""
"O número exacto de paradas da ruta.<nl/> A lista de paradas da ruta en "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> non está completa desde a última parada "
"exacta da ruta."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:480
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTypesOfVehicles' info"
msgid "The types of vehicles used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey."
msgstr "Os tipos de vehículos usados para cada tramo dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:485
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTransportLines' info"
msgid "The transport lines used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey."
msgstr "As liñas de transporte empregaras para cada tramo dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:490
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RoutePlatformsDeparture' info"
msgid ""
"The platforms of departures used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey.<nl/>If "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RoutePlatformsDeparture</"
"emphasis> are both set, the latter should contain one element less (because "
"the last stop has no departure, only an arrival platform). Elements with "
"equal indices should be associated (the platforms from which the vehicle "
"departs from the stops)."
msgstr ""
"As plataformas de saída empregaras para cada tramo dunha ruta de viaxe.<nl/> "
"Se tanto <emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como "
"<emphasis>RoutePlatformsDeparture</emphasis> están definidos, o segundo "
"debería conter un elemento menos, dado que non hai data de saída para a "
"última parada, só de chegada. Os elementos que teñan o mesmo índice deberían "
"estar asociados (as plataformas das que sae o vehículo nas paradas)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:500
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RoutePlatformsArrival' info"
msgid ""
"The platforms of arrivals used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey.<nl/>If "
"<emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RoutePlatformsArrival</"
"emphasis> are both set, the latter should contain one element less (because "
"the first stop has no arrival, only a departure platform). Elements with "
"equal indices should be associated (the platforms at which the vehicle "
"arrives at the stops)"
msgstr ""
"As plataformas de chegada empregaras para cada tramo dunha ruta de viaxe.<nl/"
"> Se tanto <emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> como "
"<emphasis>RoutePlatformsArrival</emphasis> están definidos, o segundo "
"debería conter un elemento menos, dado que non hai data de chegada para a "
"primeira parada, só de saída. Os elementos que teñan o mesmo índice deberían "
"estar asociados (as plataformas ás que chega o vehículo nas paradas)."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:510
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTimesDepartureDelay' info"
msgid ""
"A list of delays in minutes for each departure time of a route (see "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis>).<nl/>If set it should contain the "
"same number of elements as 'RouteTimesDeparture'."
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de atrasos en minutos para cada hora de saída dunha ruta de viaxe "
"(véxase <emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis>).<nl/> En caso de definir "
"este valor, debería conter o mesmo número de elementos que "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesDeparture</emphasis>."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:517
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RouteTimesArrivalDelay' info"
msgid ""
"A list of delays in minutes for each arrival time of a route (see "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis>).<nl/>If set it should contain the "
"same number of elements as 'RouteTimesArrival'."
msgstr ""
"Unha lista de atrasos en minutos para cada hora de chegada dunha ruta de "
"viaxe (véxase <emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis>).<nl/> En caso de "
"definir este valor, debería conter o mesmo número de elementos que "
"<emphasis>RouteTimesArrival</emphasis>."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:523
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Duration' info"
msgid "The duration of a journey in minutes."
msgstr "A duración da duración da ruta de viaxe en minutos."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:527
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'StartStopName' info"
msgid "The name of the starting stop of a journey."
msgstr "O nome do parada de saída dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:529 javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:537
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Needed for Journeys"
msgstr "Precísase para as rutas de viaxe"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:532
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'StartStopID' info"
msgid "The ID of the starting stop of a journey."
msgstr "A ID do comezo da parada dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:536
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'TargetStopName' info"
msgid "The name of the target stop of a journey."
msgstr "O nome da parada de destino dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:540
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'TargetStopID' info"
msgid "The ID of the target stop of a journey."
msgstr "O identificador dunha parada de viaxe dunha ruta."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:544
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'ArrivalDateTime' info"
msgid ""
"The date and time of the arrival. Can be a ECMAScript Date object. Use this "
"information instead of ArrivalDate and ArrivalTime if possible."
msgstr ""
"A data e hora de chegada. Pode ser un obxecto ECMAScript de tipo Date. Use "
"esta información en vez de «ArrivalDate» e «ArrivalTime» cando sexa posíbel."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:549
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'ArrivalDate' info"
msgid "The date of the arrival."
msgstr "A data da chegada."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:553
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'ArrivalTime' info"
msgid "The time of the arrival time."
msgstr "A hora da chegada."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:555
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "This or ArrivalDateTime is needed for journeys"
msgstr "As rutas de viaxe necesitan isto ou «ArrivalDateTime»."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:558
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Changes' info"
msgid "The number of changes between different vehicles in a journey."
msgstr ""
"O número de cambios entre distintos vehículos ao longo dunha ruta de viaxe.7"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:563
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'TypesOfVehicleInJourney' info"
msgid "A list of vehicle types used in a journey."
msgstr "Unha lista de tipos de vehículo empregados nunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:567
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'Pricing' info"
msgid "Information about the pricing of a journey."
msgstr "Información sobre o prezo dunha ruta de viaxe."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:573
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'StopName' info"
msgid "The name of a stop/station."
msgstr "O nome dunha parada ou estación."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:574
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Needed for Stop Suggestions"
msgstr "Precísase para as suxestións de parada"

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:577
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'StopID' info"
msgid "The ID of a stop/station."
msgstr "O identificador dunha parada ou estación."

#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:581
